{
  "id": "E327",
  "title": "The Fridge Broke",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-06-02",
  "synopsis": "How do you say that something broke in Chinese?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1058/cf0d427ffeb549da149e012dfe9ab34066b40d71.mp3?1560936300",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "冰箱坏了\n\n小何：听说你打算搬家？怎么这么突然？\n小张：别提了！我现在租的房子一点也不好，不是这个坏了，就是那个坏了。\n小何：真的吗？\n小张：是啊，上个月空调坏了，房东花了两个星期才修好。上个星期冰箱又坏了，刚叫人来修，就发现热水器也坏了。今天早上马桶也出了问题。真是太麻烦了！\n小何：那你赶快找个新房子吧。",
    "traditional": "冰箱壞了\n\n小何：聽說你打算搬家？怎麼這麼突然？\n小張：別提了！我現在租的房子一點也不好，不是這個壞了，就是那個壞了。\n小何：真的嗎？\n小張：是啊，上個月空調壞了，房東花了兩個星期才修好。上個星期冰箱又壞了，剛叫人來修，就發現熱水器也壞了。今天早上馬桶也出了問題。真是太麻煩了！\n小何：那你趕快找個新房子吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Fridge Broke"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何：听说你打算搬家？怎么这么突然？",
      "traditional": "小何：聽說你打算搬家？怎麼這麼突然？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé tīng shuō nǐ dǎ suàn bān jiā zěn me zhè me tū rán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I heard you are planning to move? Why so sudden?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小张：别提了！我现在租的房子一点也不好，不是这个坏了，就是那个坏了。",
      "traditional": "小張：別提了！我現在租的房子一點也不好，不是這個壞了，就是那個壞了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng bié tí le wǒ xiàn zài zū de fáng zi yì diǎn yě bù hǎo bú shì zhè ge huài le jiù shì nà ge huài le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Don’t bring it up! The apartment I rent now is not good at all, if this isn’t broken, then that is broken."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小何：真的吗？",
      "traditional": "小何：真的嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé zhēn de ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Really?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小张：是啊，上个月空调坏了，房东花了两个星期才修好。",
      "traditional": "小張：是啊，上個月空調壞了，房東花了兩個星期才修好。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng shì a shàng ge yuè kōng tiáo huài le fáng dōng huā le liǎng ge xīng qī cái xiū hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "上个星期冰箱又坏了，",
      "traditional": "上個星期冰箱又壞了，",
      "pinyin": "shàng ge xīng qī bīng xiāng yòu huài le",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Yes, last month our air-conditioner didn’t work, the landlord spent two weeks until it was fixed."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "刚叫人来修，就发现热水器也坏了。",
      "traditional": "剛叫人來修，就發現熱水器也壞了。",
      "pinyin": "gāng jiào rén lái xiū jiù fā xiàn rè shuǐ qì yě huài le",
      "english": "Last week the fridge broke as well."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "今天早上马桶也出了问题。真是太麻烦了！",
      "traditional": "今天早上馬桶也出了問題。真是太麻煩了！",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān zǎo shang mǎ tǒng yě chū le wèn tí zhēn shì tài má fan le",
      "english": "Just as we got someone to fix that, we discovered that the water heater was also broken."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This morning the toilet also had a problem. It really is too inconvenient!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小何：那你赶快找个新房子吧。",
      "traditional": "小何：那你趕快找個新房子吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nà nǐ gǎn kuài zhǎo ge xīn fáng zi ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Then you quickly need to find a new place."
    }
  ],
