    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Fridge Broke",
      "",
      "Little He: I heard you are planning to move? Why so sudden?",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: Don’t bring it up! The apartment I rent now is not good at all, if this isn’t broken, then that is broken.",
      "",
      "Little He: Really?",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: Yes, last month our air-conditioner didn’t work, the landlord spent two weeks until it was fixed.",
      "Last week the fridge broke as well.",
      "Just as we got someone to fix that, we discovered that the water heater was also broken.",
      "This morning the toilet also had a problem. It really is too inconvenient!",
      "",
      "Little He: Then you quickly need to find a new place.",
      ""
